{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 伤害结算｜流程子图\n只画一次命中如何变为属性和表现。类关系见 [[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构图]]；跨模块全链见 [[GGYGO_流程_战斗链路.canvas]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "window",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. GA 的 Montage Event 打开判定窗口。\n\n调用：PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent::OnGameplayEvent → BossMeleeAbility::HandleMontageEvent → MeleeTrace::BeginTraceWindow。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "trace",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. MeleeTrace 沿上一帧到本帧武器轨迹扫掠，并在窗口内去重。\n\n调用：MeleeTrace::TickComponent → PerformTrace → OnMeleeHit.Broadcast(Target, Hit)；EndTraceWindow 收尾。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "effect",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. GA 对目标施加伤害 GE，填 EffectContext / SetByCaller。\n\n调用：GA::HandleMeleeHit → ASC::MakeOutgoingSpec / Spec::SetSetByCallerMagnitude → ApplyGameplayEffectSpecToTarget。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "execute",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. DamageExecution 捕获源输出和目标承受属性，写 Damage / PoiseDamage 元属性。\n\n调用：DamageExecution::Execute_Implementation → 捕获 CombatSet、读 SetByCaller/物理材质衰减 → AddOutputModifier(HealthSet.Damage/PoiseDamage)。",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "health",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. HealthSet 更新生命/韧性；HealthComponent 发变化、破韧或死亡事件。\n\n调用：HealthSet::PreGameplayEffectExecute 免疫/无敌校验 → PostGameplayEffectExecute 清元属性并广播 → HealthComponent::HandleOutOfHealth。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 864,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "cue",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. GameplayCue 发布命中表现；可见特效仍取决于 Cue 资产配置。\n\n调用：BossMeleeAbility::HandleMeleeHit 直接调 TargetASC::ExecuteGameplayCue(HitCueTag, Params)；表面分流取决于所用 Cue 是否读取材质语义，不参与伤害权威。",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": 864,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "window",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "trace",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "判定启用"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "trace",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "effect",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "命中且未重复"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "effect",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "execute",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "应用 GE"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "execute",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "health",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "修改元属性"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "execute",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "cue",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "命中表现事件"
    }
  ]
}
